  "content": "<h2>WI Zoom (Wurst-Imperium 缩放模组)</h2><p>WI Zoom 是将 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.wimods.net%252ffrom%252fcurseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fwi-zoom%253fto%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.wurstclient.net%252f%253futm_source%253dCurseForge%2526utm_medium%253dWI%2bZoom%2526utm_campaign%253dDescription%2526utm_content%253dThe%2bzoom%2bfrom%2bthe%2bWurst%2bClient\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wurst客户端</a> 的缩放功能独立封装的Minecraft模组，允许您通过鼠标滚轮进行50倍放大而无需望远镜。本模组完全兼容OptiFine和Sodium，但与OptiFine的缩放不同，WI Zoom能让镜头平滑移动而不会产生晃动。支持包括快照版在内的所有最新Minecraft版本。</p><p><img src=\"https://img.wimods.net/curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wi-zoom?to=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10100202/67816432-973d2400-fab2-11e9-8699-e05eb5ba6551.jpg\" alt=\"缩放对比\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.wimods.net%252ffrom%252fcurseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fwi-zoom%253fto%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.wimods.net%252fwi-zoom%252fdownload%252f%253futm_source%253dCurseForge%2526utm_medium%253dWI%2bZoom%2526utm_campaign%253dDescription%2526utm_content%253dRequires%2bFabric%2bAPI\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></strong></a> (除非使用NeoForge)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>注意：</strong> 若已安装Wurst客户端请勿重复安装此模组，否则会导致游戏崩溃。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>最高50倍放大！</li>\n<li>无需<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.wimods.net%252ffrom%252fcurseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fwi-zoom%253fto%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fSpyglass\" rel=\"nofollow\">望远镜</a>！</li>\n<li>使用鼠标滚轮调节缩放级别！</li>\n<li>无镜头抖动现象！</li>\n<li>动态鼠标灵敏度调节！(v1.1新增)</li>\n<li>完全兼容OptiFine/Sodium！</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>使用说明</h2><p>长按<strong>V键</strong>启动缩放（可自定义按键）<br>缩放期间可通过<strong>鼠标滚轮</strong>进一步调节倍率</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>修改快捷键</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10100202/67876632-e0d45000-fb40-11e9-88a5-6d5d22cdb33a.png\" alt=\"按键设置界面\" width=\"1113\" height=\"832\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10100202/67876634-e0d45000-fb40-11e9-8e81-ef677755e1c3.png\" alt=\"控制设置界面\" width=\"1113\" height=\"779\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10100202/67876636-e16ce680-fb40-11e9-8934-ad65580dc91a.png\" alt=\"WI Zoom设置项\" width=\"1113\" height=\"599\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>支持语言</h2><ul>\n<li>阿塞拜疆语 (v1.5+)</li>\n<li>简体中文 (中国大陆) (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>繁体中文 (台湾地区) (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>粤语 (香港) (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>文言文 (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>荷兰语 (v1.5+)</li>\n<li>英语 (默认)</li>\n<li>爱沙尼亚语 (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>法语 (v1.4+)</li>\n<li>德语</li>\n<li>库尔德语 (v1.5+)</li>\n<li>葡萄牙语 (巴西) (v1.5+)</li>\n<li>俄语 (v1.3+)</li>\n<li>土耳其语 (v1.5+)</li>\n<li>乌克兰语 (v1.5+)</li>\n</ul>",
